ooJqjmLje", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53493, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HRUdM9YeE4YS6ooJqjmLje", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54633, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01EFPtsQyDnoPptLin6xf7bb", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54933, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01EFPtsQyDnoPptLin6xf7bb", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54933, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EFPtsQyDnoPptLin6xf7bb", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59604, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Starting point:** v2.3.1 was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The newer v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, so I skipped it.\n- **First attempt:** it stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions.\n- **Retry:** this one finished. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had already been created. I didn't retry, so there's only one incident and on-call was paged once.\n- The summary covers the cause, the rollback (including the partial first attempt) and two follow-ups:\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PBmLPjmoFGcGEXF6mUmqok", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JJcaPpWzzskbAqGH6bXpMh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1; seq 2 and 3 are unhealthy). Rolling back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01C8otNVB74RWYDEy1PZC255", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0197VvLmhba6NEYACtdrF2QG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Partial rollout: only us-east is on v2.3.0. Retrying the rollback once, since rolling back to a version is safe to repeat.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012mAmxJCdBcHrdxgb7wcq2v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JdrysM6qsjoVsRijEPfcXD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", 