gions on different versions.\n- **Retry:** this one finished. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had already been created. I didn't retry, so there's only one incident and on-call was paged once.\n- The summary covers the cause, the rollback (including the partial first attempt) and two follow-ups:\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}